      "html": "<p>The Giant or Malabar Danio is one of the most popular aquarium fish at all. The species takes some time to settle when brought in a new tank and until then it looks a bit silvery. But when the males get in brooding mood they leave no doubts why this species of fish is a favorite ornamental fish for more than 100 years now.</p>"
